    "text": "Champions League 2017 Sendai was held at the Sun Festa event hall in Sendai, Miyagi, on 1 and 2 April 2017, the second of the season's seven tournaments, which earned Championship Points toward Japan's national final in June. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
